  "details": "   * SECURITY UPDATE: uninitialized pointer dereference in the JBIG decoder\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-28691.patch: bail out when the JBIG decode loop\n       ends with a status other than JBG_EOK in coders/jbig.c\n     - CVE-2026-28691\n   * SECURITY UPDATE: integer overflow in the DIB coder leading to out-of-bounds read/write\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-28693.patch: guard the bytes_per_line/length\n       computations against overflow in coders/dib.c\n     - CVE-2026-28693",
